            "review_title": "Review at Blue Seafood Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Andy\nPhu Quoc Island, Vietnam6 contributions\n0\nDelicious Lobster and Fresh Seafood\nOct 2026 • Family\nHad a wonderful dining experience at Blue Seafood! 🦞✨\n\nThe lobster was definitely the highlight of our meal. It was fresh, sweet, juicy, and cooked perfectly. You could really taste the natural flavor of the lobster without the seasoning being too overwhelming.\n\nThe other seafood dishes were also fresh and delicious. The restaurant has a nice, relaxing atmosphere, and the staff were friendly and attentive throughout our visit.\n\nIf you’re visiting Phu Quoc and looking for fresh seafood, especially lobster, I’d definitely recommend giving Blue Seafood a try! 🦞❤️\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 1, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
