            "review_title": "Review at Blue Seafood Restaurant",
            "review_text": "litte beach\nPhu Quoc Island, Vietnam17 contributions\n0\nUltimate seafood experience at Blue Seafood – Irresistibly fresh!\nSep 2026 • Family\nI had the chance to visit Blue Seafood and was truly impressed by the quality of the food here. The seafood is exceptionally fresh, retaining its natural sweetness. Special mention goes to the firm, fragrant grilled lobster and the delightfully crunchy octopus, which tasted amazing when dipped in their signature sauce. The biggest highlight of the meal was the bouillabaisse—a richly flavored seafood soup packed with sweet crab meat and fresh vegetables, creating a harmonious, warm, and unforgettable flavor profile. The restaurant is clean, and the staff are prompt and attentive. I will definitely be back next time!\nRead more\nWritten September 12, 2026",
